{"id":"vod_md_4546","vodId":"4546","provider":"md","providerName":"魔都动漫","type":2,"name":"命运之夜","name_cn":"命运之夜","date":"2006-01-01","year":"2006","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"24集全","images":{"common":"https://www.mdzypic.com/upload/vod/20230909-1/0a7cd1d8a0d01b4cb56f5f183181be2a.jpg"},"summary":"十年前，几乎毁灭世界的大灾难中，卫宫士郎被魔术师卫宫切嗣所救，成为其养子。十年后，士郎为履行与已故的养父之间的约定——成为“正义的伙伴”，而每日不停的进行魔术锻炼。偶然的一天，士郎被卷入了称为“圣杯战争”的魔术师之间的对决。规则是一位魔术师与一位“英灵”结成契约。所谓“圣杯战争”，胜利者可以获得圣杯来实现任何愿望。于是，七位魔术师与七位“英灵”一起加入了这个为了创造奇迹的厮杀之中。卫宫士郎深知，十年前的那场大灾难就是“圣杯战争”引起的，为了避免悲剧再次发生，他与自己的“英灵”Sabar一起，投身于这充满危险与艰辛的”圣杯战争”之中。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-09 08:05:51","playable":true,"episodeCount":24,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"modum3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第1集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230907/s9i86yCG/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第2集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230907/fvYdE1aA/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第3集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230907/kgguszhC/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第4集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230907/FjgJGJ07/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第5集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230907/R3MtrO1p/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第6集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230907/ramd2hPE/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第7集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230907/VQKEquhP/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第8集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230907/tvlrtwOd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第9集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230907/K2NA7hSO/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230907/QFntdepG/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230907/MwsjP2lx/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230907/Y7VGtXRO/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230907/yxMPNSUP/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230907/IcB3wrCf/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230907/zkpxiaKm/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第16集","url":"https: